---
title: "MemberWithTeamsAndRelations Composition (stem-system types.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_load_member: receive Member
    q_load_member --> q_load_relations: query MemberTeamRelation by member_id
    q_load_relations --> q_iter_relations: for relation in relations
    q_iter_relations --> q_resolve_team: relation exists
    q_iter_relations --> q_load_extra: no more relations
    q_resolve_team --> q_add_team: resolve Team from relation.team_id
    q_add_team --> q_iter_relations: append to teams array
    q_load_extra --> q_load_email: raw_user_meta_data = auth metadata
    q_load_email --> q_load_avatar: email = auth email or null
    q_load_avatar --> q_check_avatar: fetch avatar
    q_check_avatar --> q_set_avatar: avatar_url != null
    q_check_avatar --> q_null_avatar: avatar_url = null
    q_set_avatar --> q_final: avatar_url = string
    q_null_avatar --> q_final: avatar_url = null
    q_final --> [*]: return MemberWithTeamsAndRelations

    note right of q_load_relations
        INV-001: relations array is raw MemberTeamRelation records
        INV-002: teams array is resolved Team objects
        INV-003: email sourced from auth provider metadata
        INV-004: all Member fields preserved in result
    end note
